Simple per-resource decision policies learned from local XES logs (BPI 2012, BPI 2017, Road Traffic Fine Management Process) plus a lightweight simulator improve next-event and suffix predictions and yield resource-level forecasts versus a case-centric LSTM.

## Related Work

